---
// Cursor de arrastre sobre el carrusel.
---

<div class="pill" id="pill">Abrir</div>

<style is:global>
/* cursor de arrastre */
.pill{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;z-index:40;pointer-events:none;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:99px;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(0)}
@media (hover:none){.pill{display:none}}

</style>
